# vectorops

A tiny vector maths package that provides `dotproduct`.

```python
from vectorops import dotproduct

assert 1 == dotproduct([1, 1], [0, 1])
```

## Install from the local index

This repository also builds and serves a local PEP 503 "simple" index on port
8080 (see `scripts/serve_index.py`):

```sh
pip install --index-url http://localhost:8080/simple vectorops==0.1.0
```

